- Obsidian Float Search, by Boninall (Quorafind) and upstream contributors
  https://github.com/Quorafind/Obsidian-Float-Search
- Float Search Window, by AiurArtanis (continues upstream 4.3.0)
  https://github.com/AiurArtanis/Obsidian-Float-Search-Window
